    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S217SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S217SI0000",
      "ID_STRING": "TXT_TITLE",
      "TEXT": "Shankry",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S217SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S217SI0000",
      "ID_STRING": "TXT_DESC",
      "TEXT": "You seek to put your mana into form, is that it? Yes, we can teach you.",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S217SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S217SI0001",
      "ID_STRING": "TXT_TITLE",
      "TEXT": "Crossroads",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S217SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S217SI0001",
      "ID_STRING": "TXT_DESC",
      "TEXT": "Doesn\u0027t matter to me which army you\u0027re from as long as your money is good.",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S217SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S217PL0000",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Neutrals",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S217SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S217PL0000",
      "ID_STRING": "DESC_TXT",
      "TEXT": "No race description",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S217SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S217PL0002",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Thorne",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S217SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S217PL0002",
      "ID_STRING": "DESC_TXT",
      "TEXT": "A veteran in the struggle to reclaim Elven glory, nobody enters the forest without his knowledge.",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S217SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S217PL0003",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Uron",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S217SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S217PL0003",
      "ID_STRING": "DESC_TXT",
      "TEXT": "In his youth, this mighty lord once stood fast against an army from hell and single-handedly defeated them by sealing the gateway that spew them. He then became sovereign of his realm.",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S217SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S217UN0003",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Beregras",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S217SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S217UN0005",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Godefroy",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S217SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S217UN000a",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Jona\u0027ath",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S217SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S217UN000b",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Kera\u0027anil",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S217SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S217UN000c",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Isuel",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S217SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S217UN000d",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Alix",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S217SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S217EV0000",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Elves - Day 1",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S217SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S217EV0000",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Guardian \n\u0022We must claim all we can in these lands before the Humans. The war effort depends on us!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S217SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S217EV0000",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Hunter \n\u0022If you listen carefully, you can hear their arrogant cheers! Their leaders prepare them to stand against us.\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 1
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S217SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S217EV0000",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Guardian \n\u0022Let them. Gallean has assured us victory.\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 2
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S217SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S217EV0001",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Empire - Day1",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S217SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S217EV0001",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Paladin \n\u0022King Emry has warned us of an assault upon Fardale\u0027s Web. The Elves intend to march through here and claim all of our resources!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S217SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S217EV0001",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Holy Avenger \n\u0022They are overconfident! How can forest vermin expect to stand against the imperial army?\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 1
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S217SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S217EV0001",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Paladin \n\u0022They\u0027ve proven themselves so far. There\u0027s something driving them and bringing their tribes together. We\u0027ll need to claim everything we can in this area before they can use it.\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 2
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S217SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S217EV0002",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Elves Win",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S217SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S217EV0002",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Guardian \n\u0022Well done! We\u0027ve secured our position in Fardale\u0027s Web. The Humans will have no choice but to retreat empty-handed to their king!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S217SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S217EV0003",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Empire Wins",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S217SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S217EV0003",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Paladin \n\u0022We\u0027ve pushed back the Elves! Without control of the Web, their army will fall before it ever reaches Temperance! King Emry will be overjoyed!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S217SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S217EV0004",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Empire - Life",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S217SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S217EV0004",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "\u0022There is an abundance of life mana here. This is a great find for our mages!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S217SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S217EV0005",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Empire - Grove",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S217SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S217EV0005",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "\u0022Elven mana. Not very useful to our mages, I\u0027d wager, but we should take it nonetheless. If the Elves were to claim it, they\u0027d have an enormous boost in power.\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S217SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S217EV0006",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Empire - Mix",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S217SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S217EV0006",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "\u0022This area holds a fortune in mana! We must claim it quickly. Send word to Emry!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S217SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S217EV0007",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Elves - Grove",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S217SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S217EV0007",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "\u0022By Gallean! Look at all this mana! Illumielle was right to send us here, this small patch alone could power an army!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S217SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S217EV0008",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Elves - Life",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S217SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S217EV0008",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "\u0022The life mana is abundant here! We musn\u0027t let this fall into Human hands. Quickly, claim it as our own!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S217SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S217EV0009",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Elves - Mix",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S217SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S217EV0009",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "\u0022There must have been a mine here...I can see many kinds of mana crystals! We will need these for our charge upon Temperance!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S217SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S217UN002e",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Orc",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
